---
---

<section id="trust" class="section-padding bg-gray-50" aria-labelledby="trust-title">
  <div class="container-custom">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 id="trust-title" class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
        Why Businesses Trust PrivateAI Systems
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        We don't just install software. We build complete AI systems that run entirely on your infrastructure.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-6">
      <div class="card text-center group">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 mx-auto mb-4 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-indigo-100 transition-colors">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-indigo-600 mx-auto" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Data Privacy</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600">Your data never leaves your premises. No third-party access.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card text-center group">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 mx-auto mb-4 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-indigo-100 transition-colors">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-indigo-600 mx-auto" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">GDPR Compliant</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600">Deployments designed for European data protection regulations.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card text-center group">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 mx-auto mb-4 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-indigo-100 transition-colors">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-indigo-600 mx-auto" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.828 10.172a4 4 0 00-5.656 0l-4 4a4 4 0 105.656 5.656l1.102-1.101m-.758-4.899a4 4 0 00-5.656 0l-4 4a4 4 0 005.656 5.656l1.102-1.101m-.758-4.899a4 4 0 00-5.656 0l-4 4a4 4 0 005.656 5.656l1.102-1.101" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Local Models</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600">Llama, Qwen, Gemma, DeepSeek, Mistral — running locally.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card text-center group">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 mx-auto mb-4 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-indigo-100 transition-colors">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-indigo-600 mx-auto" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Full Ownership</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600">Hardware, models, and data — all yours. No vendor lock-in.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card text-center group">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 mx-auto mb-4 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-indigo-100 transition-colors">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-indigo-600 mx-auto" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Enterprise Security</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600">SSH hardening, VPN access, encrypted backups, audit logs.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
